  "text": "Planning Document: Marrickville DCP 2011 - 9 14 Camdenville Precinct 14\n\nClause 9.14.1 - heritage (heritage): The precinct contains three heritage conservation areas (HCAs) being the EnmoreNewtown Heritage  Conservation  Area, part of the Enmore House Estate Heritage Conservation  Area and the Holmwood Estate H eritage  Conservation  Area .\n\nClause 9.14.2 - heritage (heritage): To protect and preserve the identified period buildings within the precinct and encourage their sympathetic alteration or restoration.\n\nClause 9.14.2 - heritage (heritage): To protect the identified Heritage Items within the precinct.\n\nClause 9.14.2 - height_limit (development_control): To maintain distinctly single storey streetscapes within the precinct.\n\nClause 9.14.2 - heritage (heritage): To protect significant streetscapes and/or public domain elements within the precinct including landscaping, fencing, open space, sandstone kerbing and guttering, views and vistas and prevailing subdivision patterns.\n\nClause 9.14.2 - zoning (land_use_zoning): To preserve the predominantly low to medium density residential character of the precinct.\n\nClause 9.14.2 - parking (development_control): To ensure the provision and location of off-street car parking does not adversely impact the amenity of the precinct.\n\nClause 9.14.2 - heritage (heritage): To protect the identified values of the Enmore -Newtown Heritage  Conservation Area, Enmore House Estate Heritage Conservation Area and the Holmwood Estate Heritage Conservation Area.\n\n",
  "metadata": {
